---
// Problem.astro
---

<section class="problem">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="problem-inner">
      <div class="problem-left">
        <span class="eyebrow reveal">Sound familiar?</span>
        <h2 class="problem-headline reveal reveal-delay-1">
          You've been burned<br/>
          <span class="serif">by agencies before.</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="problem-body reveal reveal-delay-2">
          You paid good money. Got a fancy report. And your phone didn't ring any more than it did before.
          <strong>That's not bad luck. That's the industry.</strong>
        </p>
        <p class="problem-body reveal reveal-delay-2">
          Most agencies are selling the illusion of marketing. Big promises, vague results, and retainers that keep you paying whether it works or not. You deserve something different.
        </p>

        <ul class="pain-list reveal reveal-delay-3">
          <li class="pain-item">
            <span class="pain-x"><svg viewBox="0 0 12 12"><path d="M2 2l8 8M10 2L2 10"/></svg></span>
            <span class="pain-text">Paid monthly retainers with nothing to show for it</span>
          </li>
          <li class="pain-item">
            <span class="pain-x"><svg viewBox="0 0 12 12"><path d="M2 2l8 8M10 2L2 10"/></svg></span>
            <span class="pain-text">Locked into 6–12 month contracts before seeing any results</span>
          </li>
          <li class="pain-item">
            <span class="pain-x"><svg viewBox="0 0 12 12"><path d="M2 2l8 8M10 2L2 10"/></svg></span>
            <span class="pain-text">Handed off to a junior who's still learning</span>
          </li>
          <li class="pain-item">
            <span class="pain-x"><svg viewBox="0 0 12 12"><path d="M2 2l8 8M10 2L2 10"/></svg></span>
            <span class="pain-text">No idea what they're actually doing or if it's working</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="problem-right reveal reveal-delay-2">
        <div class="fix-card">
          <div class="fix-card-label">The SupraReach way</div>
          <p class="fix-card-headline">
            What if your marketing agency actually had skin in the game?
          </p>
          <ul class="fix-items">
            <li class="fix-item">
              <span class="fix-check"><svg viewBox="0 0 12 12"><path d="M2 6l3 3 5-6"/></svg></span>
              <span class="fix-text"><strong style="color:white">Top 3 on Google Maps in 90 days</strong> — or you get your full $1,500 back</span>
            </li>
            <li class="fix-item">
              <span class="fix-check"><svg viewBox="0 0 12 12"><path d="M2 6l3 3 5-6"/></svg></span>
              <span class="fix-text">One flat fee. $1,500. No recurring charges. Ever.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="fix-item">
              <span class="fix-check"><svg viewBox="0 0 12 12"><path d="M2 6l3 3 5-6"/></svg></span>
              <span class="fix-text">Your account is handled by the expert — not passed off</span>
            </li>
            <li class="fix-item">
              <span class="fix-check"><svg viewBox="0 0 12 12"><path d="M2 6l3 3 5-6"/></svg></span>
              <span class="fix-text">Weekly ranking updates so you always know exactly where you stand</span>
            </li>
            <li class="fix-item">
              <span class="fix-check"><svg viewBox="0 0 12 12"><path d="M2 6l3 3 5-6"/></svg></span>
              <span class="fix-text">No contract. No lock-in. We deliver, or we don't get paid.</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
